{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"nav":1},[2,34,135],{"label":3,"items":4},"Start",[5,18],{"title":6,"path":7,"headings":8},"Installation","/docs/installation",[9,12,15],{"id":10,"text":11},"what-you-need","What you need",{"id":13,"text":14},"get-the-template","Get the template",{"id":16,"text":17},"make-a-site","Make a site",{"title":19,"path":20,"headings":21},"Quick start","/docs/quick-start",[22,25,28,31],{"id":23,"text":24},"1-make-the-site","1. Make the site",{"id":26,"text":27},"2-fill-in-the-config","2. Fill in the config",{"id":29,"text":30},"3-write-the-docs","3. Write the docs",{"id":32,"text":33},"4-publish","4. Publish",{"label":35,"items":36},"Guide",[37,53,78,90,103,119],{"title":38,"path":39,"headings":40},"Configuration","/docs/configuration",[41,44,47,50],{"id":42,"text":43},"fields","Fields",{"id":45,"text":46},"colours","Colours",{"id":48,"text":49},"sections","Sections",{"id":51,"text":52},"the-hero","The hero",{"title":54,"path":55,"headings":56},"Writing docs","/docs/writing-docs",[57,60,63,66,69,72,75],{"id":58,"text":59},"file-names","File names",{"id":61,"text":62},"front-matter","Front matter",{"id":64,"text":65},"the-lead","The lead",{"id":67,"text":68},"headings","Headings",{"id":70,"text":71},"code","Code",{"id":73,"text":74},"links","Links",{"id":76,"text":77},"good-docs-pages","Good docs pages",{"title":79,"path":80,"headings":81},"Changelog","/docs/changelog",[82,83,84,87],{"id":58,"text":59},{"id":61,"text":62},{"id":85,"text":86},"writing-an-entry","Writing an entry",{"id":88,"text":89},"what-the-site-makes-from-it","What the site makes from it",{"title":91,"path":92,"headings":93},"Custom hero and styles","/docs/custom-code",[94,97,100],{"id":95,"text":96},"a-custom-hero","A custom hero",{"id":98,"text":99},"custom-styles","Custom styles",{"id":101,"text":102},"everything-else","Everything else",{"title":104,"path":105,"headings":106},"Deploying","/docs/deploying",[107,110,113,116],{"id":108,"text":109},"what-it-does","What it does",{"id":111,"text":112},"your-own-domain","Your own domain",{"id":114,"text":115},"taking-a-site-down","Taking a site down",{"id":117,"text":118},"somewhere-else","Somewhere else",{"title":120,"path":121,"headings":122},"Updating a site","/docs/updating",[123,126,129,132],{"id":124,"text":125},"run-it","Run it",{"id":127,"text":128},"what-it-changes","What it changes",{"id":130,"text":131},"what-it-leaves-alone","What it leaves alone",{"id":133,"text":134},"where-the-template-comes-from","Where the template comes from",{"label":136,"items":137},"Reference",[138,148],{"title":139,"path":140,"headings":141},"Agents","/docs/agents",[142,145],{"id":143,"text":144},"having-an-agent-build-the-site","Having an agent build the site",{"id":146,"text":147},"reading-a-published-site","Reading a published site",{"title":149,"path":150,"headings":151},"Limits","/docs/limits",[152,155,158,161],{"id":153,"text":154},"two-tools-on-one-site","Two tools on one site",{"id":156,"text":157},"dns-only-on-cloudflare","DNS only on Cloudflare",{"id":159,"text":160},"github-pages-needs-a-public-repository","GitHub Pages needs a public repository",{"id":162,"text":163},"template-code-is-the-templates","Template code is the template's"],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":7,"next":10},{"title":2,"description":3,"html":4,"path":5,"group":6},"Limits","What toolsite doesn't do, and how to work around it.","\u003Cp class=\"lead\">One landing page and one docs set per site. A few things are out of scope on purpose.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"two-tools-on-one-site\">Two tools on one site\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#two-tools-on-one-site\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>A site has one landing page. If two tools ship together, give the second its own sidebar group with \u003Ccode>group: craftkit\u003C/code> in its pages&#39; front matter, and add a header link with \u003Ccode>nav\u003C/code> in \u003Ccode>site.config.ts\u003C/code>. If it stands on its own, give it its own site.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dns-only-on-cloudflare\">DNS only on Cloudflare\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#dns-only-on-cloudflare\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>The deploy script can add DNS records on Cloudflare. Anywhere else, add the \u003Ccode>CNAME\u003C/code> yourself once per domain.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"github-pages-needs-a-public-repository\">GitHub Pages needs a public repository\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#github-pages-needs-a-public-repository\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>On a free GitHub plan, so the site&#39;s source is public. The tool&#39;s own repository can stay private, because the site lives in a separate one.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"template-code-is-the-templates\">Template code is the template&#39;s\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#template-code-is-the-templates\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cpath d=\"M6.5 9.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 0l2.2-2.2a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4l-.7.7\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M9.5 6.5a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4 0L3.3 8.7a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 4 4l.7-.7\"/>\u003C/svg>\u003C/a>\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>scripts/update-site.sh\u003C/code> replaces everything in \u003Ccode>src\u003C/code> outside \u003Ccode>src/custom\u003C/code>. Put site-specific code in \u003Ccode>src/custom\u003C/code>, or add the feature to the template.\u003C/p>\n","/docs/limits","Reference",{"title":8,"path":9},"Agents","/docs/agents",null],"uses":{"params":["page"]}}]}
